<title>UK: BSkyB seeks Flextech-BBC venture stake-paper.</title>
<headline>BSkyB seeks Flextech-BBC venture stake-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>BSkyB is seeking a significant equity stake in the proposed 200 million stg pay-TV joint venture between Flextech and Britain's BBC, the Independent newspaper said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The paper said BSkyB was understood to want a significant share in the planned eight channels for agreeing to offer them to its own 3.8 million direct-to-home satellite subscribers.</p>
<p>If BSkyB's intentions were not accepted it could develop competing channels ahead of the Flextech-BBC launch as a spoiling tactic, the paper added.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
